id: super-demon-fiendish-mastery
name: Fiendish Mastery
order: 6
slot: mastery
mastery: 1
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1, 2
description: >
  Your demonic nature awakens further, unleashing deeper reserves of power.
text: >
  Fiendish Mastery (1): Your demonic nature awakens further, unleashing deeper reserves of power.
  (1)-[Permanent]: Super Demon loses M levels of the Power High Aspect.
  (2)-[Permanent]: Super Demon gains the Realization Aspect and M levels of the Scaling Aspect.
  (3)-[Passive]: The 6th effect Fiendish Power loses the [1/Encounter] Keyword and gains the [M/Round, 3/Encounter] Keywords.
  (4)-[Triggered]: If you succeed at a Pressure Check, regain M(bT) Life and Ki Points.
  (5)-[Triggered/Power, M/Encounter]: Make a Pressure Check.

